        439.23468017578125,
        510.9312744140625,
        477.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "In Namibia, livestock guard dogs have been used to protect domestic animals\nfrom attacks by cheetahs.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        478.95367431640625,
        464.42901611328125,
        517.673583984375
      ],
      "text": "This has led to a rise in the deaths of other predators, particularly 37\n__________.\n"
    },
    {
