        72.0,
        518.6747436523438,
        503.54803466796875,
        577.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "In addition, it has been suggested that the dogs could have 38 __________,\nwhich may affect other species, and that they may reduce the amount of 39\n__________ available to certain wild animals.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        578.314697265625,
        518.0612182617188,
        617.0336303710938
      ],
      "text": "On the other hand, these dogs may help birds by protecting their nests. These\nmight otherwise be threatened by predators such as 40 __________.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        631.8920288085938,
        207.86830139160156,
        651.3934326171875
      ],
      "text": "Test 4 - Writing - Task 1\n"
